    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABYSSAL BLADE</strong> is a 2D pixel-art boss rush featuring difficult raid mechanics from high-level MMO raids like <i>FFXIV Savage</i>, <i>WoW Mythic</i>, and <i>Lost Ark Legion</i> raids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY ONE LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the void, burdened by grief. At last, you find the strength to rise. But the path ahead won\u2019t be easy: <strong>you only have 1 HP</strong>. Take up your blade and break free from the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOURNEY TO DEFEAT GRIEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge five unique bosses, each embodying one of\u00a0<i>K\u00fcbler-Ross</i>\u2019s stages of grief:\u00a0<strong>Denial</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Bargain</strong>, <strong>Depression</strong>, and <strong>Acceptance</strong>. Each encounter explores a different emotional struggle, expressed through distinctive mechanics and various gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MERCILESS BOSS RAIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights take direct inspiration from high-level MMO raid mechanics, featuring cast bars, telegraphed AOEs, and precisely-timed patterns that force you to think outside of the box and act decisively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPTIMIZE YOUR DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate mana with every strike, unleashing a full gauge to enter a brief burst window of rapid, high-damaging attacks. When openings appear, time your bursts carefully to deal maximum damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABYSSAL BLADE</strong> is a 2D pixel-art boss rush featuring difficult raid mechanics from high-level MMO raids like <i>FFXIV Savage</i>, <i>WoW Mythic</i>, and <i>Lost Ark Legion</i> raids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY ONE LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the void, burdened by grief. At last, you find the strength to rise. But the path ahead won\u2019t be easy: <strong>you only have 1 HP</strong>. Take up your blade and break free from the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/caca731a5a174a37b0c4c606f2e6cfe1.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOURNEY TO DEFEAT GRIEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge five unique bosses, each embodying one of\u00a0<i>K\u00fcbler-Ross</i>\u2019s stages of grief:\u00a0<strong>Denial</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Bargain</strong>, <strong>Depression</strong>, and <strong>Acceptance</strong>. Each encounter explores a different emotional struggle, expressed through distinctive mechanics and various gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/509e010d00b37f773f0b9961cab37acc.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MERCILESS BOSS RAIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights take direct inspiration from high-level MMO raid mechanics, featuring cast bars, telegraphed AOEs, and precisely-timed patterns that force you to think outside of the box and act decisively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/c8508f58a7cc0764475ad9321ede550d.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPTIMIZE YOUR DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate mana with every strike, unleashing a full gauge to enter a brief burst window of rapid, high-damaging attacks. When openings appear, time your bursts carefully to deal maximum damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.poster.avif?t=1750814520\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.webm?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/80f7c3a7651276f059b89e2ace8e7b17.mp4?t=1750814520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
